industry":"media-entertainment","confidence":0.65,"rationale":"Museums and cultural institutions holding artwork are subject to expanded liability and jurisdictional reach under the modified claims procedures."}],"plainSummary":"This bill removes the 2026 deadline for filing lawsuits to recover art and property stolen during the Holocaust, allowing claims to be filed indefinitely as long as they are brought within six years of discovering the item. It makes it easier to sue foreign governments in U.S. courts and to serve legal papers on defendants anywhere in the country. The bill also blocks certain legal defenses, such as arguments that too much time has passed or that U.S. courts should defer to foreign laws, for both current and future cases.","classificationMethod":"llm","plain":{"whoItTouches":"People who have been the victim of a crime.","confidence":"crs-summary"},"topOverlap":{"bioguideId":"N000002","score":0.032950606363763804},"overlapCount":28},"meaning":{"percentile":59.184962881061445,"median":0.010636331736930488,"n":6331,"ordinary":[{"kind":"sponsor","text":"They wrote this bill. Sponsoring a bill about your own district's industry is the ordinary case, not the odd one."}],"unattributedShare":0.7154780527905246}},{"billId":"119-hr-5688","bioguideId":"L000597","cycle":2026,"score":0.008121182248598285,"matches":[{"industry":"construction","donorAmount":25000,"donorShare":0.013098681046126267,"billConfidence":0.5,"contribution":0.004516786567629747},{"industry":"transport","donorAmount":10500,"donorShare":0.005501446039373033,"billConfidence":0.95,"contribution":0.0036043956809685388}],"method":{"formula":"score = Σ_industries ( donorShare(industry) × billWeight(industry) ), where billWeight = classifierConfidence / Σ classifierConfidence. Range 0–1, read as a weighted share of disclosed itemized money.","donorProfileCycle":2026,"billClassificationMethod":"keyword-fallback","unclassifiedDonorShare":0.7154780527905246},"bill":{"id":"119-hr-5688","congre